  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bc406671634362a",
      "translationZh": "我的设置是不是哪里有问题？我一直得重启 vLLM，才能让 Qwen3.8-27b-FP8 停止输出胡言乱语 / 垃圾内容。运行在 RTX Pro 6000 Max-Q 上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81482fdc3db3b193",
      "translationZh": "入口点： [\"/bin/bash\", \"-c\"]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b969c994088dd3c1",
      "translationZh": "我不得不添加 --structured-outputs-config '{\"backend\": \"xgrammar\", \"disable_any_whitespace\": true}' \\，才能让结构化输出可靠地工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a939b686d6b89ccc",
      "translationZh": "我添加了 \"repetition_penalty\": 1.1 来减少垃圾输出，确实有所帮助，但 vLLM 28 似乎又让情况变糟了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "060550c8d7b5cb10",
      "translationZh": "其他人也遇到这个问题了吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ef627c06d0daf35",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/trashacct383 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
